<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes continue in the disputed Abyei border region, with Sudanese forces attacking markets and killing dozens of civilians while Sudan denies involvement and blames the RSF. Communal clashes between SSPDF and SPLA-IO forces have escalated in Lakes state, resulting in about 70 deaths, and police in Juba have arrested 43 members of the Lologo gang and investigated the killing of a central bank worker. The new UNMISS head has urged global unity to secure South Sudan's political pathway, and the U.S. Embassy remembered employees who lost their lives supporting the people. 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1Zc0dVWGU2SlJTeDhZYk12X1ZGWGpGVzJVYVFEckpRMjk4clY0SDZobE4zLU5oMzhoQXRXSWFUX2xyLVVfRFlyVGFVb2ctTVdmWHY3aE4wVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTkZja2JVNUJZenJ5Wlg3cEVkWVkzQkZvSmN5WmVoOXUwVG5kbW0zcExRdHIwYm5NWDJhNDlOcXpnWGpxZm5RbDJrU2hxTFVRVzJCZGVnYW1MVVFDU0tmZHB6S2tRWFNObWZSa0tQNnphSjJseWM4X3BrSDR0b0F6Vlp4OVU1aUJBNXVZaG1uZzZnWDY4d3VqNl9NbTUzeUxraUktMkNxbDVibTd0bTJ6cnVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT Afrika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOYno1UlFqU09OZUtvUVVGcWhWY0VUaEJhY3VEYk9HZ1VTMmdMb3RvMk9oNlBnUm9PaFMtU1Q3Sy1IcW5aTWdaUklQVXlRa0FHTmFBSUpqMU5JSllNQVpSNk1ObFk2MWxmNzRBMy1kOE5tMnVWN1dRdnd6WWdXRld6bWNhSEFuS2M3cXBoaklCbWVKdUxpN3pNODNTclQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudans Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE9JM0dVb2dqdDMxYkw1alJIOWRHQmJDSWE3T3VUOS1mOThGY2ZReW9fU2lrM096ZktDcFpXMlFrWEJ1UFJ4OHpWN3ByWW1oVjNi?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, 